  "notes": "Test fixture: every movement rule in a few cells (see tests/map_tests.cpp). Events (B-3): see the events of maps field, small and stack and tests/map_tests.cpp. Objects (B-21): see map town. Eventing (D-17): maps plaza and garden (locations, banners, a preview, pages, triggers, routes). Field rules (A1/A2): elevations 0 and 15 skip level 12 (sealed: meets only itself), 9 (overpass) meets ramp (5) and keeps the mover's level; swim walks 2 px a frame and cannot run; map small forbids running and paints the levels in its top rows (see tests/map_tests.cpp field_rules()). F2: vehicle class paddle (water only, dismounts onto land), object kind boulder (town's pacer), map tag dark and darkness 2 (map small), escape_point (map field), flight points home and town_gate (field_actions()). C8: three darkness levels of its own (darkness_levels: lit box half size 64 / 32 / 16, brightness 8 / 12 / 16). I2: the fixed-placement tileset fixed (VRAM tiles 0-7, palette banks 0-1, raw entries, an animation with a fixed phase) and its maps fixed_a / fixed_b (\"metatiles\": \"all\"; fixed_a has a fence on the east side of 2,4: behavior fence_east, walls right). I3: map crowd (object_view, 30 objects, the reference movement types, a counter: behavior counter_top, door / arrow / none / dynamic warps, stacked objects) and vehicle class trek (turn_frames 8, bumps, keeps_moving)."
